flowchart TD
  P[Poll Hypermail; checkpoint may advance] --> T[Atomic app transaction]
  T --> M[Message]
  T --> A[Activity]
  T --> N[Logical notification]
  T --> J[Agent job outbox]
  P -. crash before commit .-> R[Recent Inbox reconciliation]
  R --> U[Upsert by account + provider message identity]
  U --> T
